  {
   "id": "buildest-155709@major-2023-08-19",
   "gameId": "buildest-155709",
   "displayName": "Local co-op and sandbox update!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-08-19T06:39:09.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone! The b_0.6.013 update is here!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're here with some significant news about an update that we've been diligently working on. Let's talk about the key features:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Local Multiplayer: In response to your requests, we've added local multiplayer to our game. You can now enjoy Buildest with friends on a single computer using up to four controllers. We've made sure to optimize this experience for comfort and enjoyment.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Remote Play: For those who prefer to game from different PCs, we enabled the Remote Play Steam feature. Connect with your friends and play online.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sandbox: Buildest is finaly architecture playground. You'll have the freedom to craft your buildings, design levels with personalized level objectives, and even construct entire gaming campaigns. This extends to recreating all 46 levels from scratch, offering endless creative possibilities.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Steam Workshop Support: Sharing your creations or exploring others' designs is now made effortless through Steam Workshop integration. Dive into a pool of user-generated content and discover fresh perspectives on gameplay and design.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Alternative Camera and Settings: A new camera option with adjustable speed has been added for a refined viewing experience. Additionally, we've expanded the settings menu, providing more options for fine-tuning your gameplay environment.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug Fixes and Polish: We've dedicated time to addressing various issues and applying polishing touches across the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We greatly value your involvement and input, which have played a crucial role in refining the Buildest experience. We're genuinely excited to share this progress with you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Happy constructing!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pavel Arkhipov and Olga Arkhipova",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
