  {
   "id": "buildest-155709@6.010",
   "gameId": "buildest-155709",
   "displayName": "Update 6.010",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-04-16T17:13:18.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello everyone! In the b_0.6.010 update, we have",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "added the ability to customize keyboard controls! Some players complained about inconvenient controls, and now you can customize them to your liking - for example, move with WASD or build with Num5 - choose the keys that suit you best!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "slightly changed the tutorial, based on your gameplay experience",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "changed the logic of selection movement in project mode - now the wall selection moves in a circular manner",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed a bug with connecting 5+ players, animation freeze of builders, and a few other minor bugs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are starting to work on adding the main features - sandbox mode and local multiplayer, and continue to listen to your feedback. If you have any comments and suggestions on how to improve Buildest, we would be happy to hear them on our Discord channel.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pasha and Olya",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
